---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<Layout title="专业地陪翻译 - Sylvan Travel">
    <PageHeader 
        title="专业地陪翻译" 
        subtitle="打破语言藩篱，让您像当地人一样深度体验这座城市"
        bgImage="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1436491865333-76046997489b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80"
        breadcrumbs={[
            { label: '首页', href: '/' },
            { label: '地陪翻译', href: '/guide' }
        ]}
    />

    <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12 mb-24">
            <!-- Feature 1 -->
            <div class="group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-base-200 border border-transparent hover:border-sylvan-gold transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">💬</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-sylvan-blue mb-4">语言桥梁</h3>
                <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    不仅是翻译，更是您与当地文化之间的桥梁。精准地传递您的需求，深度地解析当地风情。
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm opacity-80">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 专业多语种同步翻译</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 复杂场景沟通无障碍</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 文化差异精准引导</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm text-sylvan-gold hover:bg-sylvan-gold hover:text-white">预约翻译 $\rightarrow$</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 2 -->
            <div class="group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-base-200 border border-transparent hover:border-sylvan-gold transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">🗺️</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-sylvan-blue mb-4">当地管家</h3>
                <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    深谙城市每一条街道的秘密。为您处理所有琐碎事务，让您在旅途中只负责享受。
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm opacity-80">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 实时预订与行程调整</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 当地突发状况快速解决</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 私密行程全程守护</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm text-sylvan-gold hover:bg-sylvan-gold hover:text-white">预约管家 $\rightarrow$</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 3 -->
            <div class="group p-8 rounded-3xl bg-base-200 border border-transparent hover:border-sylvan-gold transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">🏛️</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-sylvan-blue mb-4">文化解读</h3>
                <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    拒绝枯燥的导游词。为您提供有深度的文化解读，让每一次游览都变成一场知识的探索。
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm opacity-80">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 历史建筑深度剖析</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 当地民俗文化讲解</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✨ 艺术作品专业点评</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm text-sylvan-gold hover:bg-sylvan-gold hover:text-white">定制讲解 $\rightarrow$</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust Banner -->
        <div class="bg-sylvan-blue text-white rounded-3xl p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-32 h-32 bg-sylvan-gold opacity-20 blur-3xl rounded-full -translate-x-16 -translate-y-16"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6"> Sylvan 的地陪标准</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🎓</div>
                        <p class="text-sm opacity-80">高学历背景，文化底蕴深厚</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🤫</div>
                        <p class="text-sm opacity-80">职业操守，绝对保护隐私</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💖</div>
                        <p class="text-sm opacity-80">热爱生活，充满热情与耐心</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
